Unified Edit Extension

This extension is derived from unified-edit.ts in mitsuhiko/agent-stuff:
https://github.com/mitsuhiko/agent-stuff/blob/c77d49797ad3fb78888e5b002ae606a93777c6b1/extensions/unified-edit.ts

Copyright 2025 Armin Ronacher and contributors.
Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

Local changes replace the upstream Box/Text live diff preview with the bounded,
width-safe Apex tool receipt renderer and Apex diff presentation. Apex loads this
module directly so only one extension registers the built-in `edit` tool name.
